@startuml mill-web
title Web mill
left to right direction
rectangle "Browser\nSPA" as Browser
rectangle "Stratum pool" as Pool
rectangle "DATUM Gateway" as Gw
rectangle "Node" as Node
rectangle "DATUM Prime" as Prime
Browser --> Pool : WSS /stratum
Browser --> Gw : WSS /stratum
Gw --> Node : GBT submitblock
Gw --> Prime : DATUM
note bottom of Browser
  Hasher never speaks DATUM.
  Localhost needs Apps On Device.
end note
@enduml
